	(text "PWM INPUT BUFFERING\n74LVC2G17 running from +3.3 V. Chosen because LVC inputs accept up to\n5.5 V regardless of VCC - so a 3.3 V or a 5 V MCU both work, with no\nassumption about which. Output drives the IR2184 (VIH 2.7 V min) with\n0.6 V margin; the datasheet lists 3.3 V drive as supported.\nR201-R204 pull the inputs low so an unplugged harness turns both low-side\nFETs ON - coil shorted through Q2/Q4, slow decay. Safe state by default."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 84.836 161.798 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
		)
		(uuid "7ab1c72b-0ea9-4612-9623-8ba5608c2db9")
	)
	(text "RAIL ENTRY\nRails are supplied by the pod - this board does not generate them.\nD201 does two jobs: blocks reverse polarity, and isolates C201 so the\n220 µF stays on this board when the pod's 12 V collapses.\nC201 is the hold-up for slow-decay-on-fault: the gate drivers must stay\nalive ~60 ms after the 60 V bus dies. 220 µF over a 12→10.5 V window\nholds ~330 µC, enough for ~5 mA of driver quiescent - and only because\nthe gates are STATIC during slow decay. If anything is still switching,\ngate charge dominates and this is far too small."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 239.014 215.646 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
		)
		(uuid "88cc0f34-64bf-46fc-9d0e-4ce2496e5b6d")
	)
	(text "OUTPUT CONDITIONING\n100 Ω in series on every signal leaving the board, protecting the on-chip\ndriver from a shorted harness.\nC209/C210 sit on the CONNECTOR side of R208/R209: the resistor isolates\nthe INA240 from the capacitance, and the RC gives a 16 kHz filter on the\noutgoing copy. The window comparators tap ISNS upstream on power_channel,\nso the over-current trip stays fast regardless.\nRESET IS PULL-LOW-ONLY. The 74HC74 runs from +5 V and needs 3.5 V to\nrelease CLR. Drive RESET low to clear a fault, then RELEASE it - the\non-board pull-up provides the high level. A 3.3 V MCU driving it high\nwould sit at 3.3 V, which is ambiguous, and you could lose fault latching\nentirely."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 104.14 98.552 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
		)
		(uuid "d3334052-ba26-4d63-aa3d-39de410f5717")
	)
